<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER - UEFA CUP SECOND PRELIMINARY ROUND DRAW.</title>
<headline>SOCCER - UEFA CUP SECOND PRELIMINARY ROUND DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the UEFA Cup second</p>
<p>preliminary round made on Friday:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Hajduk Split (Croatia) v Malmo (Sweden)</p>
<p>Anderlecht (Belgium) v Vorskla Poltava (Ukraine)</p>
<p>Neuchatel Xamax (Switzerland) v Viking Stavanger</p>
<p>(Norway)</p>
<p>Rotor Volgograd (Russia) v Odra Wodzislaw (Poland)</p>
<p>Trabzonspor (Turkey) v Dundee United (Scotland)</p>
<p>Rapid Vienna (Austria) v Boby Brno (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Tirol Innsbruck (Austria) v Celtic (Scotland)</p>
<p>Helsingborgs (Sweden) v Ferencvaros (Hungary)</p>
<p>Vejle (Denmark) v Hapoel Petah Tikvah (Israel)</p>
<p>Grasshopper Zurich (Switzerland) v Brann Bergen (Norway)</p>
<p>HIT Gorica (Slovenia) v Club Brugge (Belgium)</p>
<p>PAOK Salonica (Greece) v Spartak Trnava (Slovakia)</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>KR Reykjavik (Iceland) v OFI Crete (Greece)</p>
<p>Jablonec (Czech Republic) v Orebro (Sweden)</p>
<p>Apollon Limassol (Cyprus) v Excelsior Mouscron (Belgium)</p>
<p>Dynamo Minsk (Belarus) v Lillestrom (Norway)</p>
<p>Ujpest (Hungary) v Aarhus (Denmark)</p>
<p>Alanlia-Vladikavkaz (Russia) v Dnipro Dnipropetrovsk (Ukraine)</p>
<p>Matches to be played on Aug 12 and 26.</p>
